  "whatsNewBody": "Kaydi halka aad kaararkaaga ku haysato iyo lambarka xannibaadda bangi kasta. Haddii boorsadu kaa lunto, wax walba waxaad ku xannibaysaa daqiiqado.",
  "whatsNewDismiss": "Waan fahmay",
  "tutorialAddRecordMoreDetails2": "Faahfaahin dheeraad ah waxay haysaa waxyaabaha dheeraadka ah: qoraallo, ku celin, waqtiga cusboonaysiinta, cidda iska leh, halka aad ku haysato, quful iyo sawirro. Fur kaliya marka aad u baahato.",
  "tutorialAddRecordProtect2": "Quful diiwaan si uu u weydiiyo faraha ama qufulka shaashadda ka hor inta aan la muujin. Dooro halka aad ku haysato, sida boorsadaada, oo ku dar sawirrada dukumentiga.",
