  "storyHome1Title": "Maalintaada hal jalleec",
  "storyHome1Body": "Shaashadda guriga waxay muujinaysaa waxa muhiimka ah maanta: waxa dhowaan dhacaya iyo inta diiwaan ee aad haysato.",
  "storyHome2Title": "Hel wax kasta",
  "storyHome2Body": "Taabo raadinta si aad u hesho diiwaan magac, koox ama qof ahaan.",
  "storyHome3Title": "Safarro iyo qorshayaal",
  "storyHome3Body": "Safarrada aad qorshaynayso iyo qorshayaasha dhacdooyinka nolosha ee socda halkan ayay ka muuqdaan, iyo waxa haray.",
  "storyHome4Title": "Caawimo hal taabasho",
  "storyHome4Body": "Badhanka dhimbiisha wuxuu furaa «Weydii Vaultara». Sawirkaagu wuxuu furaa astaantaada, dejimaha iyo casharrada.",
  "storyRenew1Title": "Xusuusin ayaa timid",
  "storyRenew1Body": "Ka hor inta uusan diiwaan dhicin, Vaultara ayaa ku xusuusinaysa. Taabo xusuusinta si aad u furto diiwaanka.",
  "storyRenew2Title": "Kaydi taariikhda cusub",
  "storyRenew2Body": "Ma cusboonaysiisay? Taabo «Cusboonaysii» oo geli taariikhda dhicitaanka cusub. Xusuusinadaadu way la socdaan.",
  "storyRenew3Title": "Ma hubtid sida?",
  "storyRenew3Body": "Diiwaanno badan waxay leeyihiin hage leh tallaabooyinka, dukumentiyada iyo qiimaha caadiga ah.",
  "storyRenew4Title": "Ha ku celiyo",
  "storyRenew4Body": "Rukummada iyo lacag-bixinta sannadlaha ah, daar ku celinta oo taariikhdu iskeed ayay u dhaqaaqaysaa.",
  "storyAsk1Title": "Ku weydii ereyadaada",
  "storyAsk1Body": "Weydii wax sida «Maxaa dhacaya sannadkan?» oo ka hel jawaabo diiwaannadaada.",
  "storyAsk2Title": "Hadal halkii aad qori lahayd",
  "storyAsk2Body": "Taabo makarafoonka oo hadal. Ereyadaadu waxay soo baxaan inta aad hadlayso waxaadna isla markiiba diri kartaa.",
  "storyAsk3Title": "Adiga ayaa xaqiijiya isbeddel kasta",
  "storyAsk3Body": "Codso in diiwaan lagu daro ama la beddelo, waxaadna marka hore arki doontaa kaar. Waxba lama kaydiyo ilaa aad xaqiijiso.",
  "storyAsk4Title": "Ka noqo isbeddel kasta",
  "storyAsk4Body": "Fikirka ma beddeshay? Isbeddel kasta oo la xaqiijiyay waa laga noqon karaa isla kaarkaas.",
  "storyAsk5Title": "Ka sii wad halkii aad ka joogsatay",
  "storyAsk5Body": "Wadahadallada waxaa lagu hayaa 90 maalmood «Taariikhda wada hadallada», su'aalaha la soo jeediyayna waxay kaa caawinayaan inaad bilowdo.",
  "storyWallet1Title": "Marka hore isu diyaari",
  "storyWallet1Body": "Fur kaar ama dukumenti oo dooro halka aad ku haysato, sida boorsadaada ama shandaddaada.",
  "storyWallet2Title": "Kaydi lambarka xannibaadda",
  "storyWallet2Body": "Hadda ku dar lambarka xannibaadda bangi kasta. Wuxuu ku yaal kaarka, oo aanad haysan doonin marka aad u baahato.",
  "storyWallet3Title": "Haddii uu lumo",
  "storyWallet3Body": "Fur «Boorsadaydii way lumday» oo taabo «Lumay» ama «La xaday». Vaultara waxay taxaysaa wax walba oo ku jiray.",
  "storyWallet4Title": "Xannib kaararka daqiiqado gudahood",
  "storyWallet4Body": "Wac bangi kasta hal taabasho, calaamadee kaararka inay xannibmeen oo kaydi lambarka warbixinta.",
  "storyWallet5Title": "Beddel oo ammaan ahaw",
  "storyWallet5Body": "Beddel dukumentiyadaada, hubi bayaannada xisaabta marka lagu xusuusiyo oo taabo «Waan helay» haddii uu soo baxo.",
  "storyLife1Title": "Waqtiyo waaweyn, hal qorshe",
  "storyLife1Body": "Guuritaan, ilmo, shaqo cusub ama xaalad degdeg ah: ku dooro «Dhacdooyinka nolosha» waxa dhacaya.",
  "storyLife2Title": "Diiwaannadaada, habaysan",
  "storyLife2Body": "Qorshuhu wuxuu muujinayaa diiwaannada la cusbooneysiinayo, la joojinayo ama dib loo cusboonaysiinayo, iyo kuwa laga yaabo inaad ku darto.",
  "storyLife3Title": "Tallaabooyin iyo taariikho",
  "storyLife3Body": "Tallaabooyinku waxay daboolaan waxa aan diiwaan ahayn, taariikhaha bilowguna waxay kuu sheegaan goorta aad codsanayso si aanay waxba u daahin.",
  "storyLife4Title": "Ka dhig mid adiga kuu gaar ah",
  "storyLife4Body": "Ku dar tallaabooyinkaaga, la wadaag qorshaha PDF ahaan oo hel xusuusin agagaarka taariikhda.",
  "storyPhotos1Title": "Sawirrada dukumentiyadaada",
  "storyPhotos1Body": "Diiwaanka dhexdiisa, ku dar sawirrada wejiga hore iyo dambe ee kaar ama dukumenti.",
  "storyPhotos2Title": "Sir-qarsoon taleefankaaga",
  "storyPhotos2Body": "Daar sir-qarinta sawirrada waxaana lagu quflaa taleefankaaga ka hor inta aan la soo gelin.",
  "storyPhotos3Title": "Quful diiwaannada xasaasiga ah",
  "storyPhotos3Body": "Quful diiwaan wuxuuna weydiin doonaa faraha ama qufulka shaashadda ka hor inta uusan furmin.",
  "storyPhotos4Title": "Quful abka oo dhan",
  "storyPhotos4Body": "Dejimaha amniga, daar qufulka abka oo qari waxa ku jira marka aad abka beddesho.",
  "storyShare1Title": "La wadaag hal diiwaan",
  "storyShare1Body": "Fur diiwaan oo la wadaag xiriiriye muujinaya kaliya diiwaankaas, wax kale ma jiraan.",
  "storyShare2Title": "Xirmada caddaynta",
  "storyShare2Body": "Geli diiwaannada aad doorato, sawirradooda la socda, hal PDF oo loogu talagalay mulkiilaha guriga, bangi ama xafiis.",
  "storyShare3Title": "Gacanta ku hay",
  "storyShare3Body": "«Linkiyada la wadaagay» wuxuu muujinayaa xiriiriye kasta oo aad samaysay. Jooji mid kasta wakhti kasta mar dambena ma furmayo.",
  "storyHousehold1Title": "Casuun qoyskaaga",
  "storyHousehold1Body": "La wadaag koodh ama xiriiriye casuumaad. Qof kastaa wuxuu ku galaa akoonkiisa.",
  "storyHousehold2Title": "Hal koox diiwaanno",
  "storyHousehold2Body": "Qof kastaa wuxuu arkaa diiwaannada la wadaago ee isku midka ah wuxuuna helaa xusuusinno isku mid ah.",
  "storyHousehold3Title": "Yaa iska leh?",
  "storyHousehold3Body": "Diiwaan kastaa wuxuu noqon karaa mid qof leeyahay. Magaciisu wuu ku muuqdaa iyo xusuusinadiisa.",
  "storyImport1Title": "Iskaan samee kaar",
  "storyImport1Body": "Sawir kaar ama dukumenti, Vaultara ayaa kuu buuxinaysa magaca iyo taariikhda dhicitaanka.",
  "storyImport2Title": "Soo deji liis",
  "storyImport2Body": "Horey ma u haysataa xaashi xisaabeed? Soo deji oo hubi saf kasta ka hor inta aan wax la kaydin.",
  "storyImport3Title": "U wadaag Vaultara",
  "storyImport3Body": "La wadaag sawir, PDF ama qoraal ka yimid ab kale Vaultara si aad u bilowdo diiwaan cusub.",
  "storyCosts1Title": "Kalandarkaaga",
  "storyCosts1Body": "Ku dar taariikhaha dhicitaanka kalandarka taleefankaaga, oo ag yaal qorshayaashaada kale.",
  "storyCosts2Title": "Qiimaha cusboonaysiinta",
  "storyCosts2Body": "Geli qiimaha cusboonaysiinta diiwaan, Vaultara ayaa muujinaysa inta aad sannadkii ku bixiso.",
  "storyCosts3Title": "Hore u qorshee",
  "storyCosts3Body": "Arag bilaha qaaliga ah intaanay iman si cusboonaysiin weyn aanay kuu yaabin.",
  "storyBusiness1Title": "La soco kooxdaada",
  "storyBusiness1Body": "Ku dar shaqaale oo hal meel ku hay shahaadooyinkooda, ogolaanshaha iyo liisannadooda.",
  "storyBusiness2Title": "Xusuusin iimayl ah",
  "storyBusiness2Body": "Shaqaaluhu waxay helaan iimaylo ka hor inta aysan dukumentiyadoodu dhicin, xataa la'aan abka.",
  "storyBusiness3Title": "Warbixin bille ah",
  "storyBusiness3Body": "Bil kasta warbixin ayaa muujisa waxa ansax ah, waxa dhacaya iyo waxa maqan.",
  "storyBusiness4Title": "Codso cusboonaysiin",
  "storyBusiness4Body": "Dir xiriiriye, shaqaalaha ayaa isagu soo gelinaya dukumentiga la cusboonaysiiyay.",
